756
01:05:58,022 --> 01:06:02,002
"... to believe that death ended absolutely?"
"... zu glauben, dass der Tod absolut endete?"

757
01:06:04,159 --> 01:06:06,948
"It is possible to die."
"Es ist möglich zu sterben."

758
01:06:08,659 --> 01:06:11,784
"It is possible to die."
"Es ist möglich zu sterben."

